<title>UK: Petrobras sets $150 mln one-yr notes issue.</title>
<headline>Petrobras sets $150 mln one-yr notes issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following notes issue was announced by lead manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PETROBRAS DISTRIBUIDORA SA</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    28.NOV.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.825    PAY DATE    27.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	REOFFER    99.825    SPREAD	+200 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND ONE-YEAR U.S. DOLLAR LIBOR -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
